{"availability":"available","full":"subhashDev11/subhash-portfolio","name":"subhash-portfolio","description":"Explore this public GitHub project.","category":"Design","language":"Dart","stars":3,"forks":0,"created":"2023-08-15T14:55:49Z","updated":"2023-08-15T16:01:53Z","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":"https://subhash-dev-ca050.web.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T04:51:26.144Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T04:51:26.144Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T04:51:26.144Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T04:51:26.144Z","stars":3,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Subhash's Portfolio is a Flutter Web project designed to showcase Subhash's professional profile and accomplishments. This project demonstrates the integration of various features including animation, responsive user interface, dynamic data handling, navigation to external URLs, and a menu with options such as academic background, experience, notes & blog, and an about us section.","Myself is Subhash Chandra Shukla, an experienced Flutter developer with a passion for creating engaging and user-friendly applications. My journey in the world of development has led me to explore various aspects of software engineering, and I'm excited to share my portfolio as a testament to my skills and expertise."],"features":["The portfolio incorporates subtle and engaging animations to enhance user experience and add a touch of interactivity. These animations are strategically placed to highlight key sections and elements on the website.","The user interface of the portfolio is designed to be responsive, ensuring a seamless experience across a variety of devices and screen sizes. This responsiveness is achieved through Flutter's responsive design…","The portfolio dynamically handles and displays Subhash's professional data. This data is fetched from a data source, allowing for easy updates and modifications to Subhash's achievements, projects, and other relevant…","Users can navigate to external URLs directly from the portfolio. This feature is utilized to link to Subhash's social media profiles, GitHub repositories, and other online presence, providing a comprehensive view of his…","Academic Background: This section provides information about Subhash's educational qualifications, highlighting his academic journey."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/subhashDev11/subhash-portfolio/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"971eaf15003ca5a62a6edd47981e9ab9e3c49ab84ec9f84affe1feba39b38265","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T04:51:26.239Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T04:51:26.239Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Subhash's Portfolio is a Flutter Web project designed to showcase Subhash's professional profile and accomplishments. This project demonstrates the integration of various features including animation, responsive user interface, dynamic data handling, navigation to external URLs, and a menu with options such as academic background, experience, notes & blog, and an about us section.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/subhashDev11/subhash-portfolio/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"971eaf15003ca5a62a6edd47981e9ab9e3c49ab84ec9f84affe1feba39b38265","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/subhashDev11/subhash-portfolio/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T04:51:26.240Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2023-08-15T16:01:53Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/subhashDev11/subhash-portfolio/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T04:51:26.240Z","hash":"971eaf15003ca5a62a6edd47981e9ab9e3c49ab84ec9f84affe1feba39b38265","originalBytes":3982,"storedBytes":3982,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["subhash","portfolio","flutter","project","about","experience","explore","his","allowing","data","responsive","web","academic","background","features","license","menu","navigate","options","professional","section","user","various"